    291  0a44							;------------------------------------------------------------- interrupts
    292  0a44							; Every 1/4 ms: take a MIDI-in byte, feed the ACIA one byte (fast path).
    293  0a44							; Every fourth time (1 ms):
    294  0a44							; count a tick and move paced messages onto the wire.
