    534  2156							; tremolo LFO, every 10 ms: tremA = 0-15. The sound's own (NES pulses with
    535  2156							; an envelope), the menu's TREMOLO ON (the ADVANCED SOUND values) or TREMOLO
    536  2156							; held (SPACE / a button): those two also move the SID's volume and the NES
